        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***Fantastic Location***\n***Easy Access For Naas or Newbridge***\n\nByrne Malone Estate Agents are delighted to present Barnehurst, an attractive detached three-bedroom bungalow set on its own private site extending to approximately 0.32 acres. Surrounded by mature trees and shrubs, the property enjoys an exceptional sense of privacy and seclusion while remaining conveniently located just 3km from Newbridge Town Centre, with its excellent range of primary and secondary schools, shops, and local amenities.\nUpon entering the home, you are welcomed by an inviting porch with tiled flooring, leading into a bright entrance hallway featuring wooden flooring and elegant wall panelling, creating a warm and stylish first impression.\nTo the left of the hallway lies the spacious sitting room, complete with wooden flooring, a built-in log fire, and a large picture window that floods the room with natural light while offering lovely views over the surrounding gardens.\nThe generously proportioned kitchen is fully fitted with ample storage and worktop space, making it ideal for modern family living. A separate dining area overlooks the garden, providing a wonderful setting for both everyday family meals and entertaining guests.\nThe accommodation comprises three bright and spacious bedrooms, all finished with wooden flooring. The principal bedroom benefits from fitted wardrobes and a recently renovated en-suite bathroom, beautifully appointed with high-quality finishes.The family bathroom has also been tastefully renovated and features luxury fixtures and fittings, creating a stylish and contemporary space.\nExternally, the property offers ample parking to the front. To the rear, the generous garden boasts a large lawn area and a patio, providing the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining, or simply relaxing in the privacy of this mature and tranquil environment.\nBarnehurst offers an exceptional combination of comfortable family living, privacy, and outdoor space, making it an ideal home for those seeking the charm of country living while remaining within easy reach of excellent local amenities.\nThe location provides superb connectivity for commuters, with the M7 motorway just minutes away, ensuring quick and convenient access to Dublin. Both Newbridge Train Station and Sallins & Naas Train Station are within a short drive, offering additional transport options. The towns of Newbridge and Naas are approximately five and ten minutes away respectively, providing an excellent selection of shopping, recreational, and educational facilities.\nViewing is highly recommended.\n"
